│                          │ 3. Maintain chain connectivity but make it more efficient                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This should:                                                                              │
│                          │ - Reduce overfitting (fewer degrees of freedom)                                           │
│                          │ - Improve parameter efficiency                                                            │
│                          │ - Potentially increase convergence speed                                                  │
│                          │ - Maintain or improve generalization                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight is that the pre- and post-entanglement RZ rotations likely have redundant │
│                          │ capacity. By sharing parameters smartly and using parametrized 2-qubit gates, we get      │
│                          │ better expressivity with fewer parameters.                                                │
