│ patch_name               │ enhanced_entanglement_with_rx                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ The current design achieves good performance (0.86) with parameter sharing and CRY gates. │
│                          │ To further improve:                                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Add RX gates on all qubits before the RZ gates - this provides additional rotation     │
│                          │ freedom in the X-basis and is known to improve quantum circuit expressiveness for many    │
│                          │ problems.                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. Add diagonal CRY entanglement gates (connecting qubits with stride 3-4) in addition to │
│                          │ the nearest-neighbor and next-nearest-neighbor gates already present. This creates a more │
│                          │ connected entanglement pattern without excessive parameters.                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. The strategic additions maintain the efficient parameter sharing philosophy while      │
│                          │ increasing the circuit's ability to learn complex features.                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 4. This should improve generalization (reduce the validation-test gap) and potentially    │
│                          │ increase test accuracy by providing better feature extraction before the main             │
│                          │ entanglement layers.                                                                      │
