│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_phase_block_and_consolidate                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ Add an auxiliary initial RZ phase block before the RY encoding layer to enrich the early  │
│                          │ optimization landscape, and consolidate redundant parameters to reduce total parameter    │
│                          │ count. This addresses the current program's slow convergence (300 steps) and high         │
│                          │ parameter count (68).                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The initial RZ block uses two shared parameters following the even/odd qubit pattern,     │
│                          │ adding only 8 gates and 2 parameters while providing richer phase initialization.         │
│                          │ Simultaneously, consolidating the pre-entanglement RZ layer (rz_prep_a/b) and simplifying │
│                          │ final layers reduces unnecessary parameters.                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected improvements:                                                                    │
│                          │ - Faster convergence due to smoother early-stage optimization landscape                   │
│                          │ - Reduced parameter count (from 68 to ~56) improving parameter efficiency                 │
│                          │ - Better generalization by avoiding parameter redundancy                                  │
│                          │ - Maintain or improve validation accuracy based on prior program insights                 │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
