│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ swap_cry_with_crz_forward                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the ineffective CRY cross-talk layer with selective parametrized CRZ gates in the │
│                          │ forward entanglement chain. This strategy:                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Removes the Layer 4 CRY cross-talk gates (4 parameters, adds circuit depth without     │
│                          │ clear benefit)                                                                            │
│                          │ 2. Replaces two fixed CZ gates in the forward chain ([1,2] and [5,6]) with parametrized   │
│                          │ CRZ gates sharing a single parameter "crz_fwd"                                            │
│                          │ 3. Simplifies the final RY layer to use paired parameters (ry_final_a, ry_final_b)        │
│                          │ instead of a single shared parameter                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This reduces parameters from 68 to 54 while maintaining the expressivity gains from       │
│                          │ parametrized controlled rotations. The approach mirrors the successful reverse-chain CRZ  │
│                          │ pattern that proved effective in prior programs, but now applies it selectively in the    │
│                          │ forward direction for early-circuit tunability. Fewer parameters combined with reduced    │
│                          │ circuit complexity should accelerate convergence and improve generalization.              │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0156                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
