│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_linear_chain_with_crx_core                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ The current program deviates from the proven architecture that achieved 0.91 combined     │
│                          │ score. It replaced the linear chain CZ entanglement with a star topology using CRY gates, │
│                          │ which led to:                                                                             │
│                          │ - 4% drop in validation accuracy (0.93→0.89)                                              │
│                          │ - 2% drop in test accuracy (0.90→0.87)                                                    │
│                          │ - Worse generalization gap (0.02→0.05)                                                    │
│                          │ - 48% more parameters (50→74) with worse performance                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This change restores the core structure that worked well:                                 │
│                          │ 1. Reinstate the linear chain CZ entanglement (proven effective, low-depth)               │
│                          │ 2. Keep the parametrized CRZ reverse chain (was part of prior 0.91 solution)              │
│                          │ 3. Add strategic X-axis rotation (CRX) at the circuit core (qubits 2-4 region) to         │
│                          │ introduce localized axis variation and test whether X-axis entanglement boosts            │
│                          │ expressivity in the middle layers                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The hybrid CRZ/CRX reverse chain maintains parameter efficiency while testing a new       │
│                          │ degree of freedom. This returns to the proven foundation while incorporating targeted     │
│                          │ improvements.                                                                             │
