│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_proven_pattern_with_cry_enhancement                                               │
│ patch_description        │ The current program achieved 0.87 by using a sparse skip-link topology and grouped RY     │
│                          │ parameters, but this hurt accuracy compared to the prior programs that scored 0.91. The   │
│                          │ prior programs used:                                                                      │
│                          │ 1. Alternating RY parameters (ry_a, ry_b) instead of grouped                              │
│                          │ 2. Forward linear chain followed by reverse parametrized chain                            │
│                          │ 3. Mid-circuit RZ layers for phase flexibility                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The current architecture is too simplified. We restore the proven pattern and enhance it  │
│                          │ with the recommended CRY gates in the reverse chain core (replacing the two central CRZ   │
│                          │ gates with CRY gates sharing a single parameter). This adds mixed-axis expressivity while │
│                          │ maintaining parameter efficiency, testing whether Y-axis rotations in the reverse chain   │
│                          │ boost performance beyond Z-only CRZ.                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This targets the key insight: the prior 0.91 program had better topology and layer        │
│                          │ structure; we enhance it with the CRY recommendation for potential further gains.         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0205                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 13; deleted: 0; modified: 35;                                                      │
