│                          │ pattern. Prior Program 1 achieved 0.91 score with selective RZ rotations on even/odd      │
│                          │ qubits placed between the forward CZ chain and reverse CRZ chain, resulting in fast       │
│                          │ convergence (180 steps). Current program has degraded convergence (330 steps) despite 50  │
│                          │ parameters.                                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
