│                          │ rz_mid_b) after the forward CZ chain and before the reverse CRZ chain.                    │
│                          │ 2. Adds strategic fixed CZ gates within the reverse chain to strengthen mid-circuit       │
│                          │ entanglement mixing without adding parameters.                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These changes restore the proven mid-circuit phase modulation and connectivity patterns   │
