│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ crx_reverse_axis_variation                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Introduce cross-axis entanglement by replacing two CRZ gates in the reverse chain with    │
│                          │ CRX gates using a shared parameter. This strategy:                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ - Replaces CRZ gates at positions [5,4] and [2,1] with CRX gates, introducing axis        │
│                          │ diversity                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Uses a single shared "crx_rev" parameter for both new CRX gates to maintain parameter   │
│                          │ efficiency                                                                                │
│                          │ - Preserves the alternating CRZ pattern at other positions (7,6), (6,5), (4,3), (3,2),    │
│                          │ (1,0)                                                                                     │
│                          │ - Breaking the all-CRZ homogeneity can stabilize gradient flow and reduce the             │
│                          │ validation-test gap                                                                       │
│                          │ - This mixed-axis approach has shown promise in prior generations and aligns with the     │
│                          │ recommendation                                                                            │
│                          │ - Expected outcome: Maintain validation accuracy while improving test accuracy and        │
│                          │ reducing generalization gap                                                               │
