│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ parametrize_forward_chain_crz                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ Replace fixed CZ gates in the forward linear chain with parametrized CRZ gates using      │
│                          │ alternating shared parameters (crz_fwd_a and crz_fwd_b). This mirrors the successful      │
│                          │ alternating CRZ pattern from prior high-scoring programs applied to the reverse chain.    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The forward chain currently provides no trainable degrees of freedom for interaction      │
│                          │ strength tuning. Adding alternating CRZ parameters enables:                               │
│                          │ 1. Early-stage expressivity and interaction control                                       │
│                          │ 2. Reduced convergence steps through better initial tuning capability                     │
│                          │ 3. Balanced parameter efficiency (back to ~50 params) while maintaining discriminative    │
│                          │ power                                                                                     │
│                          │ 4. Symmetry with the reverse chain's successful alternating parameter scheme              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This directly addresses the current program's slower convergence (300 vs 180 steps) by    │
│                          │ restoring architectural flexibility lost when oversimplifying the reverse chain to a      │
│                          │ single shared parameter.                                                                  │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0136                                                                                   │
