│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ linear_chain_parametrized_both_directions                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ The prior successful programs (score 0.91) used a linear chain topology with fixed        │
│                          │ forward CZ gates and parametrized reverse CRZ gates with alternating parameters. The      │
│                          │ current program switched to a star topology with CRY hub gates, but this degraded         │
│                          │ performance significantly (score 0.87, validation_accuracy 0.89, test_loss 0.51,          │
│                          │ convergence_step 270).                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit returns to the proven linear chain architecture but parameterizes BOTH the      │
│                          │ forward and reverse chains with alternating CRZ gates. This maximizes expressivity by:    │
│                          │ 1. Making forward entanglement tunable instead of fixed (forward chain: alternating       │
│                          │ crz_fwd_a/crz_fwd_b)                                                                      │
│                          │ 2. Keeping the proven reverse chain (crz_rev_a/crz_rev_b)                                 │
│                          │ 3. Simplifying the ansatz by removing underperforming star topology elements              │
│                          │ 4. Maintaining efficient parameter sharing (2 params per direction = 4 total for          │
│                          │ entanglement)                                                                             │
│                          │ 5. Reducing depth and gate count while improving convergence                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This aligns with the recommendation to parameterize the forward chain with shared CRZ,    │
│                          │ which should accelerate convergence and boost the combined score closer to 0.91+.         │
